RUF070 [*] Unnecessary assignment to `x` before `yield` statement
 --> RUF070.py:7:11
  |
5 | def foo():
6 |     x = 1
7 |     yield x  # RUF070
  |           ^
8 |
9 | def foo():
  |
help: Remove unnecessary assignment
  |
6 -     x = 1
7 -     yield x  # RUF070
8 - 
6 +     yield 1
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

